IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-4a`

-- Tests of P2-art-4a.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.


§ `Article 10(5) as enacted: the permission before the Omnibus`

-- Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the scope of the text: the AI system is a high-risk AI system is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the scope of the text: the party is a provider of the AI system is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the scope of the text: the data processed are special categories of personal data is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the scope of the text: the processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to high-risk AI systems in accordance with Article 10(2), points (f) and (g) is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING


