-- Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data (the dispatcher). Facts in order: provider, special categories, strictly necessary, safeguards, GDPR, conditions (a) to (f).
-- Chapter I applies from 2 February 2025 (Art 113(a)); the text as enacted is the text until 26 July 2026, and Article 10(5), in Chapter III, did not yet apply: NOTHING on each of these days.
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 1 2 2025) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 2 2 2025) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- From 27 July 2026 Article 4a(1) is the text and Chapter I applies: JUST TRUE where every condition is met.
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 28 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The Article 6(1) route and a system that is not high-risk: Article 4a(1) speaks of high-risk AI systems.
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not met: appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the grant: the party is a provider of the AI system is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the grant: the data processed are special categories of personal data is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the grant: the processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to high-risk AI systems in accordance with Article 10(2), points (f) and (g) is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The two texts side by side (the hand-over): the same facts, the same answer, through each text's own function (no date).
-- args: high-risk system, then the same eleven facts
-- a condition unmet: both texts answer JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) as amended the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- every element met: both texts answer JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) as amended the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a system that is not high-risk is not covered by either text
#ASSERT `Art 10(5) as enacted the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 4a(1) as amended the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING


§ `Article 4a(2): other AI systems and models, and deployers of high-risk AI systems`

-- Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data
-- the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a)): not covered
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter I begins to apply, under the text as enacted: the provision is not in that text (silent)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the last day of the text as enacted: the provision is not in that text (silent)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element met, by a provider of an AI system other than a high-risk one (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a deployer of another AI system (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a deployer of a high-risk AI system (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a provider of a high-risk AI system (the party of none of the three limbs): paragraph 1 speaks to it, not paragraph 2 (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not special categories of personal data (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not strictly necessary: outside the grant (a) (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- paragraph 1's safeguards are not applied: (b) (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the GDPR provisions are not complied with (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- paragraph 1's condition is not applied: the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- paragraph 1's condition is not applied: the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- paragraph 1's condition is not applied: the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- paragraph 1's condition is not applied: the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- paragraph 1's condition is not applied: the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- paragraph 1's condition is not applied: the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day after: the same facts, the same answer
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` (Date 28 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- Art 4a(2) last sentence the paragraph creates an obligation to conduct bias detection and correction
-- the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a)): not covered
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) last sentence the paragraph creates an obligation to conduct bias detection and correction` (Date 1 2 2025)  EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter I begins to apply, under the text as enacted: the provision is not in that text (silent)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) last sentence the paragraph creates an obligation to conduct bias detection and correction` (Date 2 2 2025)  EQUALS NOTHING
-- the last day of the text as enacted: the provision is not in that text (silent)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) last sentence the paragraph creates an obligation to conduct bias detection and correction` (Date 26 7 2026)  EQUALS NOTHING
-- the paragraph creates no obligation to conduct bias detection and correction, whatever the facts (the first day of the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) last sentence the paragraph creates an obligation to conduct bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026)  EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day after: the same facts, the same answer
#ASSERT `Art 4a(2) last sentence the paragraph creates an obligation to conduct bias detection and correction` (Date 28 7 2026)  EQUALS JUST FALSE
